Ok! Here's a death of a tired adventurer ...

   MacRaven was was between levels 3-5 when he ran into a hardware store. He
discovered that there was a magic lamp on that shop. MacRaven got a wish!!!
What a lucky guy!!! His AC was quite good already, but what he really needed
was a weapon ... MacRaven left the shop with his new Frosty.
   Then he did something on that level, but didn't encounter any monsters. On
that time he lost his grip from a stream of thougts. He went downstairs with
his pet and saw three hill orcs. MacRaven knew that it would be a piece of cake
with this equipment. There was no doorway near and retreating to better
position was impossible. He had to face them all at the same time. Well not
too hard he thought. MacRaven swings the first one:

"You begin bashing monsters with your magic lamp"

Aarch!!! There was something about the command "rub" I had totally forgotten...
Next command: wield (whatever that letter was, anyway Frost Brand)

"Hill orc hits! Hill orc hits! Hill orc hits! -- more --"
"You die .."

Better luck next time ...

But hey! Funny causes of deaths, I'd like to see some. My favourite is:

  "Crushed in the head by an iron-ball"

  Shouldn't be too hard to guess how this happened ...


